  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup unsalted butter",
    "1 cup crunchy peanut butter",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "1 cup packed brown sugar",
    "2 large eggs",
    "2.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1.5 teaspoons baking soda",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0oMGdxlsT8tnuN2BNQgOjzugB_M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-10275-classic-peanutbutter-cookies-ddmfs-ingredients-3x4-5e43d07b57204469b7756d093ad621cd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10275/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter, peanut butter, white sugar, and brown sugar with an electric mixer in a large bowl until smooth; beat in eggs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CTFRAPAiiGiELnyhrbnTN_b1-kw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-10275-classic-peanutbutter-cookies-ddmfs-step1-3x4-c9092fafbd2e4ea889b82247fea7c6cb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10275/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift flour, baking soda, baking powder, and salt into a separate bowl; stir into butter mixture until dough is just combined. Chill cookie dough in the refrigerator for 1 hour to make it easier to work with.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JOaTgzIjXrzhFmGVWi0T6OH0ZaM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-10275-classic-peanutbutter-cookies-ddmfs-step2-3x4-de30a0aa88df4719a19f5026057c5834.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10275/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Roll dough into 1-inch balls and place 2 inches apart onto ungreased baking sheets. Flatten each ball with a fork, making a crisscross pattern.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YFVN8R117qKxHzeCD45yk7QF5AY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-10275-classic-peanutbutter-cookies-ddmfs-step3-3x4-21d5446e39ec4cb496d6009813797054.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10275/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until edges are golden, about 7 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-mBOI9ErSgxX9Knj1XRPB3MN6d8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-10275-classic-peanutbutter-cookies-ddmfs-step4-3x4-35aad0c345bb440290a14fc0ed2cdad2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10275/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cool on the baking sheets briefly before removing to a wire rack to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Mz85ZEvKQdOEUwBBvPn_8DtilvI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10275-classic-peanut-butter-cookies-KimShupe-4x3-89eb10741f3a4df2b439672ad3b0e306.jpg"
      ],
